  "configuration_id": "config_051",
  "reason": "The current best is config_009 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.725 accuracy. All four aggregation×fusion combinations for scvi_n200+imagenet_vit_l+multiprofile have been tested, and resnet50 variants are consistently ~1% lower. The major untested dimension is pca_n2000 in multiprofile mode with the best aggregation/fusion settings. Config_051 (pca_n2000, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) directly tests whether a linear RNA encoder can match or beat the deep scvi_n200 encoder under the strongest architecture. If pca_n2000 performs comparably, it reveals the RNA encoder is not the bottleneck and the last experiment can focus on fine-tuning other axes; if it underperforms significantly, it confirms scvi_n200 is essential and validates that config_009 is near the ceiling of this search space. This is the highest-information experiment remaining: it reduces uncertainty about the most impactful unexplored design choice before the final experiment."
}

